# Spectrum Components Dependency Map and Rules

## Component Dependency Map

This map shows the relationships between Spectrum components. Keep this updated when implementing or modifying components.

### Core Infrastructure Components (Foundation Layer)
- **spectrum-theme**: Foundation theming component
  - Dependencies: @material/material-color-utilities, FontLoader utility
  - Used by: All components (through CSS custom properties)
  - Coordinates with: spectrum-wallpaper (via events for color extraction)
  - Purpose: Provides Material Design 3 color system, theming, and FOUC prevention

### Atomic Components (No Internal Dependencies)
- **spectrum-avatar**: User profile avatar component
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)
  - Used by: User interfaces, profile displays, and identity visualization
  - Purpose: Display user profile images, initials, or icons with status indicators and interactive states

- **spectrum-button**: Interactive button component
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)
  - Used by: spectrum-conversation-panel, spectrum-image-gallery, spectrum-rail, spectrum-rail-item, spectrum-search-input, spectrum-select, spectrum-cookie-compliance, spectrum-dialog
  - Purpose: Primary interactive element

- **spectrum-chip**: Small interactive element for tags/selections
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)  
  - Used by: spectrum-accordion, spectrum-conversation-panel
  - Purpose: Display tags, selections, or actionable items

- **spectrum-switch**: Toggle switch component for binary choices
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)
  - Used by: spectrum-wizard
  - Purpose: Toggle switch for on/off, true/false, or enabled/disabled states with accessibility support

- **spectrum-badge**: Status and notification badge component
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)
  - Used by: spectrum-image-gallery
  - Purpose: Display status, counts, notifications, and selection indicators

- **spectrum-toast**: Notification component for user feedback
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button
  - Used by: spectrum-cookie-compliance, standalone notifications and user feedback systems
  - Purpose: Display temporary notifications, alerts, and user feedback messages

- **spectrum-dialog**: Modal dialog component
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button
  - Used by: spectrum-cookie-compliance, modal applications, settings panels
  - Purpose: Display modal dialogs with configurable content and actions

- **spectrum-panel**: Versatile container component with optional frost effects
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)
  - Used by: spectrum-conversation-panel, spectrum-image-gallery, spectrum-cookie-compliance
  - Purpose: Flexible content container with background effects and customizable sizing

- **spectrum-media-library**: Comprehensive media library component with lightbox viewer
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)
  - Used by: Media galleries, portfolios, documentation systems, and media management applications
  - Purpose: Display images and videos in a scrollable grid with integrated lightbox viewer, automatic YouTube thumbnail extraction, and full keyboard navigation

- **spectrum-dashboard**: Dashboard container component
  - Dependencies: @stencil/store, DataSourceManager, DashboardStore, WidgetRegistry
  - Used by: Dashboard applications, analytics interfaces, monitoring views
  - Purpose: JSON-driven dashboard engine with CSS Grid layout, centralized data management, and filtering
  - Status: Production ready - Core infrastructure complete

- **spectrum-chart**: Chart visualization component
  - Dependencies: chart.js (external)
  - Used by: Data visualization, dashboard widgets, analytics displays
  - Purpose: Flexible chart component supporting multiple chart types (line, bar, pie, etc.)
  - Status: Production ready - Works standalone and as dashboard widget

### Utility Components
- **spectrum-context-menu**: Contextual menu overlay
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)
  - Used by: spectrum-collapsible-list, spectrum-rail
  - Purpose: Provides contextual actions menu
  - Exports: ContextMenuAction interface
  - Recent Updates: Enhanced positioning system with support for 'bottom' alignment to prevent clipping at screen edges

- **spectrum-wallpaper**: Background theming component
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)
  - Used by: Standalone background theming
  - Coordinates with: spectrum-theme (via events for color coordination)
  - Purpose: Dynamic background with color extraction and theme coordination

- **spectrum-search-results**: Search results display component with pagination
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button
  - Used by: Search interfaces, result displays, and data presentation applications
  - Purpose: Display search results with pagination, loading states, and interaction events

### Composed Components (With Internal Dependencies)
- **spectrum-accordion**: Expandable content container
  - Dependencies: spectrum-chip
  - Used by: spectrum-conversation-panel
  - Purpose: Collapsible content sections with chip-based triggers

- **spectrum-search-input**: Enhanced search input with voice
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button
  - Used by: spectrum-rail
  - Purpose: Advanced search functionality

- **spectrum-rail-item**: Individual rail navigation item
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button
  - Used by: spectrum-rail (via slots)
  - Purpose: Rail navigation items with expand/collapse states

- **spectrum-wizard**: Step-by-step guided experience component
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button, spectrum-chip, spectrum-switch
  - Used by: Onboarding flows, multi-step forms, configuration processes, and guided user experiences
  - Purpose: Provides step-by-step navigation with progress tracking, cookie-based persistence, time estimation, and comprehensive accessibility support
  - Recent Updates: Consistent use of spectrum-chip (size="small", variant="primary") for all time indicators; chips display time value only; content area shows "Estimated time:" label outside the chip; completed step indicators use success color (green) while step titles maintain normal text color

- **spectrum-collapsible-list**: Hierarchical list with context menus
  - Dependencies: spectrum-context-menu (imports ContextMenuAction interface)
  - Used by: spectrum-rail (via slots)
  - Purpose: Expandable/collapsible navigation lists

- **spectrum-select**: Comprehensive select/dropdown component
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button
  - Used by: Form components and data input applications
  - Purpose: Single and multiple selection dropdown with search capabilities

- **spectrum-image-gallery**: Flexible image gallery with upload capabilities
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button, spectrum-badge, spectrum-panel
  - Used by: Image management and display applications
  - Purpose: Responsive image gallery with thumbnail navigation, upload, and selection

- **spectrum-hero**: Hero section component with carousel functionality
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button
  - Used by: Landing pages, feature highlights, and content showcase applications
  - Purpose: Hero sections with image/video backgrounds, text overlays, and call-to-action buttons

- **spectrum-cookie-compliance**: GDPR-compliant cookie consent component
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button, spectrum-toast, spectrum-dialog
  - Used by: Privacy and compliance applications, GDPR implementations
  - Purpose: Cookie consent management with Google Tag Manager integration, granular user preferences, and persistent status indicator

### Complex Components (Multiple Internal Dependencies)
- **spectrum-rail**: Main navigation rail
  - Dependencies: spectrum-button, spectrum-search-input (via slots), spectrum-collapsible-list (via slots), spectrum-rail-item (via slots), spectrum-context-menu (imports ContextMenuAction interface)
  - Used by: Main navigation component
  - Purpose: Primary navigation with expand/collapse functionality
  - Recent Updates: Added context menu support for the "more" button with customizable actions and proper positioning

- **spectrum-conversation-panel**: Chat/conversation interface
  - Dependencies: spectrum-accordion, spectrum-button, spectrum-chip, spectrum-panel
  - Used by: AI/chat applications
  - Purpose: Message display and interaction with expandable content
  - Recent Updates: Enhanced source card overlay system with smart positioning to prevent viewport clipping, grid-based layout for up to 9 source cards (3x3), improved hover interactions

### Standalone Components (External Dependencies Only)
- **spectrum-carousel**: Image/content carousel
  - Dependencies: @glidejs/glide (external)
  - Used by: Content display
  - Purpose: Interactive content carousel

- **spectrum-megamenu**: Full-screen navigation menu
  - Dependencies: None (uses native popover API)
  - Used by: Complex navigation scenarios
  - Purpose: Large navigation overlay

- **spectrum-menu**: Responsive navigation menu with megamenu variant
  - Dependencies: None (pure component)
  - Used by: Navigation systems, header menus, sidebar navigation
  - Purpose: Horizontal/vertical menus with regular submenus or full-width megamenu dropdowns
  - Features: Mobile responsive, Material icons, accessibility support

